cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: >-
  Please cite this software and the accompanying study when reusing the workflow.
  We will add the public repository URL and an archived release DOI when available.
title: Tropical cyclone precipitation evaluation with triple and extended collocation
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Diaz
    given-names: Miguel
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  We provide our data acquisition, track-based event windows, conservative
  regridding, matched-sample analysis, TC/ETC, four-product EC, storm-block
  bootstrap, storm-omission sensitivity, reference-agreement diagnostics,
  and publication-figure routines.
keywords:
  - precipitation
  - tropical cyclones
  - triple collocation
  - extended collocation
  - uncertainty
